agent_user_id, bigint, false, , user_account.id, cascade
created_at, timestamptz, false, now(), , 

### indexes
name, columns
user_card_agent_agent_user_id, "agent_user_id"

## table role | doc="Application role. user_role assigns these to user_account rows; role_grant lists what (card_type, process) pairs each role may invoke. rank orders the built-in roles, each of whose grants contains the ones below it: viewer 1 < commenter 2 < worker 3 < manager 4 < admin 5 (0 = unranked, covers only itself). An agent may use a role its owner holds or ranks above (role_covers)."

