## table admin_bootstrap | doc="One row once the workspace has its first admin (docs/DESIGN_INVARIANTS.md DI-2). Written by the init-admin bootstrap, by the OIDC sign-in that grants the first admin, and by any sign-in that finds an admin already there. While the row exists no sign-in is ever made admin automatically again, even if every admin later loses the role (restore one with KITP_INIT_ADMIN_EMAIL). The primary key on singleton (always true) lets only one transaction claim it."

