## table flow_step | doc="One transition edge in a flow. from_card_id and to_card_id both point at value cards on the same attribute_def as the flow. Tasks always have a real status value-card (status is a required attribute), so there is no 'from unset' case — every transition is real → real. label is the button text; the UI TONE (positive/danger/accent/neutral) is derived at render time from (from_card.phase, to_card.phase). requires_role_id NULL means any authenticated user. sort_order orders entries for deterministic rendering. standalone is the presentation bit the TransitionBar reads identically for task AND comm status: true = its own button, false = folded into the bar's overflow dropdown." | unique="flow_id, from_card_id, to_card_id, label"

