## table comm_inbound_seen | doc="Message dedupe (docs/MAIL_INTAKE_AND_CALENDARS.md §4): one row per message filed in a project, whichever account or transport (imap / post / smtp) it came through. message_key is 'mid:' + the Message-ID without its angle brackets, or 'h:' + a SHA-256 of From, To, Date, Subject and body for mail with none. The filing transaction inserts the row first; a conflict means a duplicate (logged, not filed). card_id is the thread the first copy became. last_seen_at is bumped by every duplicate; rows are pruned KITP_COMM_DEDUPE_DAYS (default 14) after it." | primary_key="project_id, message_key"

