## table comm_log | doc="Per-project ring buffer of channel-level events (poll cycles, messages received / duplicate / refused, send attempts, bounces, parse errors). route_id names the inbound route (card_access row, no FK: the log outlives a deleted route) a POST / SMTP event came through, so the Comm log filters to one route. Decoupled from cards because the volume is high and a parse error before identification has no card to attach to. Retention via a periodic prune gated by KITP_COMM_LOG_RETENTION_DAYS."

