checksum, text, , false, '', ,
updated_at, timestamptz, , false, now(), ,


## table area | doc="Catalog of the switchable areas a project is split into (Tasks, Conversations, Approvals, Content, Sites), materialised from db/schema/bundles/areas.hcsv by store.ApplySchema on every boot. card_types are the item types whose data belongs to the area; depends_on the areas it needs; starts the feature bundles it can start from (first = default). Code-owned. See docs/AREAS.md."

