## table card_origin | doc="Provenance: which feature bundle item a card was copied from. One row per card copied by copy_project_template_merge with an origin; item_key is the source card's path inside its bundle (card_type:title segments joined by '/'), stable across re-materialisations. Re-applying a bundle skips items whose (bundle_key, item_key) already exists in the target project, so enabling a feature twice is a no-op and a later bundle version can add only what's new." | primary_key="card_id"

