## table publication | doc="What one portal shows for one page: a snapshot of the page taken when it entered a status whose publishes_to names the portal (publication_on_status). Leaving that status does not unpublish — editing a live page leaves the portal on the pinned revision until the page re-enters a publishing status; entering a terminal-phase status withdraws it from every portal. revision_activity_id is the page's newest activity row at snapshot time." | primary_key="portal_id, card_id"

