## function page_publications_batch | doc="page.publications — the portals a page is published to, with snapshot time / author, whether the snapshot is current, and the page's path in each portal's active build." | path="functions/page_publications_batch.sql"
## function project_compose_batch | doc="project.compose — create a project from a preset and/or feature list (no template auto-stamp), applying each feature bundle in order; any conflict fails the row." | path="functions/project_compose_batch.sql"
