## function card_merge_batch | doc="card.merge — fold duplicate cards of the SAME card_type into a survivor via card_merge_into (validates existence / non-deleted / same-type). For duplicate milestones / components / tags / persons." | path="functions/card_merge_batch.sql"
## function person_merge_batch | doc="person.merge — merge duplicate person cards: validate all are live persons, move a sole user_account_person link to the survivor (reject 'merge_login_conflict' when >1 record has a login), backfill the survivor's blank email from a loser, then card_merge_into." | path="functions/person_merge_batch.sql"
## function card_move_batch | doc="card.move — re-parent + activity row per input, with parent-type compatibility check." | path="functions/card_move_batch.sql"
## function card_set_phase_batch | doc="card.set_phase — write the structural phase column + activity row per input." | path="functions/card_set_phase_batch.sql"
