## function user_set_display_name_batch | doc="user.set_display_name — admin-only update of user_account.display_name; idempotent (updated=false when the value already matches). /auth/me reads display_name straight from this column, so it powers the shell's signed-in user chip." | path="functions/user_set_display_name_batch.sql"
