## function card_private_ok | doc="Whether an account may see / write a card as far as privacy goes: the card isn't private, or it is private to account_person(actor). ANDed into the listing reads that can surface private cards; VisibilityClause and card_visible_to apply the same rule." | path="functions/card_private_ok.sql" | arg_types="bigint, bigint"
## function my_screen_toggles | doc="The phase toggles a personal screen starts with: New / Active (on) / Closed over its listed card type's status attribute (status or comm_status), as toggle_groups JSON." | path="functions/my_screen_toggles.sql" | arg_types="text"
