## function my_screen_set_batch | doc="my_screen.set — create or update one of the caller's personal screens: title, layout (list | grid), list_card_type (task | comm), base filter (predicate; a project leaf limits it to some projects), sort_order, default_filter." | path="functions/my_screen_set_batch.sql"
