## function watched_on | doc="Whether a card is on any of the given watch lists, an id also naming a person = any of that person's lists. Backs the watch_list filter leaf." | path="functions/watched_on.sql" | arg_types="bigint, bigint[], bigint"
## function watch_list_list_batch | doc="watch_list.list — the caller's watch lists (title, symbol, description, count; with card_id whether that card is on each). The first call makes the account's Stars list." | path="functions/watch_list_list_batch.sql"
