## function comm_create_batch | doc="comm.create — admin-only insert of a comm card under a task. Mints a unique 10-char alphanumeric thread_id, writes title/channel_ref/thread_id/comm_status via the ordinality-join idiom, optional comm_recipients + initial_message → reply_body, appends to task.comms." | path="functions/comm_create_batch.sql"
