## function project_import_set_mapping_batch | doc="project.import.set_mapping — UPDATE the job's mapping JSONB; advance status to 'mapped' (unless already past 'mapped' in which case mapping changes but status holds)." | path="functions/project_import_set_mapping_batch.sql"
## function project_import_preview_batch | doc="project.import.preview — dry-run pass that walks the pre-parsed CSV rows, applies the mapping + resolution config, returns would_create counts + per-row error log, and persists resolution + summary on the job row." | path="functions/project_import_preview_batch.sql"
## function project_import_commit_batch | doc="project.import.commit — apply the import: auto-create persons / milestones / components / tags via card_insert_batch, insert tasks via a single card_insert_batch call, mark the job 'completed'. Fail the tx on any row resolution error." | path="functions/project_import_commit_batch.sql"
